Tn=Tn−2+(n−1)​Tn−1.T_{n}=T_{n-2}+(n-1)T_{n-1}.
System 3.2 can be written as the following augmented matrix Mn=(A|B)M_{n}=(A|B), where AA is an (n−1)×(n−1)(n-1)\times(n-1) matrix and BB is a (n−1)×1(n-1)\times 1 column vector. We denote the element in the iith row and jjth column as Mni,jM_{n}^{i,\,j}, where 1≤i≤n−11\leq i\leq n-1 and 1≤j≤n1\leq j\leq n.
Mn=(10−1−1−1…−1−1−11−110−1−1…−1−1−110−120−1…−1−1−11⋮⋮00000…−1n−30100000…0−1n−20)M_{n}=\left(\begin{array}[]{@{}*{9}{c}|c@{}}1&0&-1&-1&-1&\ldots&-1&-1&-1&1\\
